** Purpose
Fast, no-frills search across TODO/FIXME/BUG/HACK keywords in buffers
and projects using consult. No views, no query language — just a live
picker that lands you on the line.

** Setup

*** Guix
#+begin_src scheme
emacs-consult-todo  ; custom declaration in config.scm
#+end_src

** Customization

*** Config
Selectors are derived from the Cyberdeck TODO AIU context, so the narrow
tracks the vocabulary automatically — FIXME, BUG and HACK were never
todo states and matched nothing, while DOING, WAIT, DONE and the rest
of the AIU context were unreachable from here.
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(when-let* ((narrow (my/subnet-consult-todo-narrow)))
  (setq consult-todo-narrow narrow))
#+end_src

